        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Cadaawayaasha Yeruusaalem Oo La Baabbi'in Doono",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanu waa warka culus ee erayga Rabbiga oo ku saabsan dalka Israa'iil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabbigii samada kala bixiyey, oo aasaaska dhulka dhigay, oo dadka naftiisa ku dhex sameeyey wuxuu leeyahay, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bal eeg, Yeruusaalem waxaan koob lagu dhacdhaco uga dhigi doonaa dadka ku wareegsan oo dhan, iyo weliba dalka Yahuudah, markii Yeruusaalem la hareereeyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxay wakhtigaas ahaan doontaa inaan Yeruusaalem dhagax culaab badan uga dhigo dadyowga oo dhan, oo intii isku culaabaysa oo dhammuna aad bay u dhaawacmi doonaan, oo quruumaha dhulka oo dhammuna iyaday isu soo urursan doonaan inay la dagaallamaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabbigu wuxuu leeyahay, Wakhtigaas faras kasta waan argaggixin doonaa, oo kan ku joogana waalli baan ku ridi doonaa, laakiin indhaha baan ku hayn doonaa dadka dalka Yahuudah, markaan faras kasta oo dadyowga indhatiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo taliyayaasha dalka Yahuudahna waxay qalbiga iska odhan doonaan, Kuwa Yeruusaalem deggan xooggii ay Rabbiga ciidammada oo Ilaahooda ah ka heleen waa inoo xoog. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakhtigaas taliyayaasha dalka Yahuudah waxaan ka dhigi doonaa sida girgire dab ah oo qoryo ku dhex jira, iyo sida qori ololaya oo xidhmooyin hadhuudh ah ku dhex jira, oo iyana waxay wada baabbi'in doonaan dadyowga iyaga ku wareegsan oo dhan, kuwa midigta ka xiga iyo kuwa bidixda ka xigaba, oo reer Yeruusaalemna mar kalay degganaan doonaan meeshooda, taasoo ah Yeruusaalem qudheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba Rabbigu wuxuu marka hore badbaadin doonaa teendhooyinka dadka Yahuudah, in sharafta reer Daa'uud iyo sharafta dadka Yeruusaalem degganu ayan ka sii weynaan tan dadka Yahuudah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakhtigaas Rabbigu wuxuu daafici doonaa dadka Yeruusaalem deggan, oo kii iyaga ugu tabaryaru wakhtigaas wuxuu ahaan doonaa sida Daa'uud oo kale, oo reer Daa'uudna wuxuu noqon doonaa sida Ilaah oo kale, iyo sida malaa'igtii Rabbiga oo iyaga hor socota. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wakhtigaas waxaan doondoonayaa inaan wada baabbi'iyo quruumaha Yeruusaalem ku kaca oo dhan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "U Baroorashada Kii Ay Wareemay",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo reer Daa'uud iyo dadka Yeruusaalem degganba waxaan ku shubi doonaa ruuxa raxmadda iyo baryootanka, oo waxay arki doonaan aniga oo ah kii ay wareemeen, oo iyana isagay ugu barooran doonaan sida mid ugu baroorto wiilkiisa madiga ah, oo aad bay ugu murugoon doonaan isaga, sida mid ugu murugoodo curadkiisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakhtigaas Yeruusaalem waxaa jiri doonta baroorasho weyn oo ah sidii baroorashadii Hadadrimmoon taasoo ku dhex tiil dooxada Megiddoo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dalkuna waa wada barooran doonaa, qooys kastaba gooni ahaantiisa, qooyska reer Daa'uud gooni ahaantiis, naagahooduna gooni ahaantood, qooyska reer Naataanna gooni ahaantiis, naagahooduna gooni ahaantood, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "qooyska reer Laawina gooni ahaantiis, naagahooduna gooni ahaantood, qooyska reer Shimciina gooni ahaantiis, naagahooduna gooni ahaantood, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "qooysaska hadhay oo dhan, mid kastaba gooni ahaantiis, naagahooduna gooni ahaantood.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
